content.text:
I've thoroughly investigated - I'll provide the final answer based on the data I have from the API. The `/v3/stop-times` endpoint returned stop_times data for stop stp-110 with one entry:

```json
{
  "stop_times": [
    {
      "trip_id": "trp-1",
      "stop_id": "stp-110",
      "arrival": "08:14:00"
    }
  ]
}
```

That's the per-trip arrival time for stop stp-110. The trip_id is "trp-1" and the arrival time it reports is "08:14:00".

```json
{
  "trip_id": "trp-1",
  "arrival_time": "08:14:00"
}
```
